#: ../../../fuel.md:1
msgid "About Fuel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel.md:3
msgid ""
"Fuel is a two-part web application for hosting and accessing simulation "
"assets. The first part is the [https://app.gazebosim.org website](https://"
"app.gazebosim.org), which displays assets in a human consumable manner. The "
"second part is a backend server that manages the simulation assets. See the "
"[REST API](https://app.gazebosim.org/api) pages for more information about "
"the backend server's API."
msgstr ""

